# Android handheld debug device

When building or installing the **new** 手持跑账 App (not `android-waiter-app` WebView, not `android-cashier-shell`):

- Device: **Samsung Galaxy Tab S8 Ultra Wi-Fi** (`SM-X900`, `gts8uwifi`)
- Serial: `R52T10050XD`
- OS: Android 16 (API 36)
- ADB: `adb -s R52T10050XD …` (USB debugging already authorized on this PC)

Install/debug on this tablet. Confirm `adb -s R52T10050XD get-state` is `device` before deploy. If `unauthorized` or missing, ask Lei to unlock and allow USB debugging.

Do not use iOS Simulator or `lzfood_phone` emulator as the default target for this app.
